he perfect team to help you progress through the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter a variety of magical creatures and NPCs, all inspired by tabletop role-playing games. And don\u2019t forget to collect any legendary treasures and items you might uncover during your adventures. You\u2019ll need them to triumph over the dangers you\u2019ll face!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866980/extras/92480f64eb2fa193861a1e52af323485.avif?t=1746043355\" width=600 height=80 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866980/extras/ca149404c899506b286407d690bf19be.poster.avif?t=1746043355\" width=600 height=265 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866980/extras/ca149404c899506b286407d690bf19be.webm?t=1746043355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone or with up to 4 people in online, local, and cross-platform play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your friends can join you for free with the Friends Pass!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry out a legendary quest in a fantasy world brimming with drama narrated by Laura Bailey!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collaborate to accomplish your goals as a team, or scheme for your own gains. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll the dice to reveal the outcome of your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roleplay to your heart\u2019s content! Choose between 12 characters, each with a unique skillset, personality, and voice. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tabletop experience come to life! Dungeon dive and encounter creatures and characters inspired by fantasy TTRPGs. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set sail on the open seas, find your way through gloomy mines, take over a small business selling mead\u2014Aria is chock-full of exciting places to explore!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Packed with replayability, reroll the dice and retell the story in brand new ways.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Ludogram"],"dlc":[3325450,2961620],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866980/header.jpg?t=1746043355","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OSX 10.9 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1866980/760428/f8a9ecf16f38ecf7a530c73e24e888e824c54131/1750739097/dash_av1.mpd?t=1739824402","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1866980/760428/f8a9ecf16f38ecf7a530c73e24e888e824c54131/1750739097/dash_h264.mpd?t=1739824402","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1866980/760428/f8a9ecf16f38ecf7a530c73e24e888e824c54131/1750739097/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1739824402","id":257057901,"name":"Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257057901/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1739824402"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1866980/722230/b395688a8abdafd11e0a040e777ae1dbf8a82184/1750739097/dash_av1.mpd?t=1739824405","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_